    {
      "id": "own-little-world",
      "type": "thought",
      "title": "My own little world",
      "date": "2026-09-24",
      "pull": "I want somewhere it can be my own little world.",
      "body": [
        "I started this web project just to really learn about code, and because I find social media to be toxic these days. I want somewhere it can be my own little world, and to help me remember things, since I don't have a good memory.",
        "My favorite part is Rosie's blog, which made me redo my entire website just because of how creative, unique, and separate the page felt from what I had before.",
        "The hardest thing is trying to remain consistent, have it all fit, and talk about myself or post about myself on this Life section. I long left the Life section empty because I simply feel uncomfortable talking about myself in any manner, since I don't post anywhere and like to remain private.",
        "I don't know what to do next. I want to add more movies to my watched so it looks better, but I have no idea what other pages I could make or how else I want to explore this."
      ]
    }
  ]
}